{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_development_plan_mode_design_plan_mode", "label": "Plan Mode", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/development/PLAN_MODE_DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Inspired by Claude Code's planning capabilities: the LLM explores the codebase read-only, produces a structured plan with subtasks, and executes only after explicit user approval. Goals: safer execution, better task management, user architectural control, progress tracking, and flexibility to use different models for planning vs execution."}, {"id": "docs_development_plan_mode_design_plan_document", "label": "PlanDocument Structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/development/PLAN_MODE_DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_development_plan_mode_design_plan_task", "label": "PlanTask Structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/development/PLAN_MODE_DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_development_plan_mode_design_tool_restrictions", "label": "Plan Mode Tool Restrictions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/development/PLAN_MODE_DESIGN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In Plan mode only read-only tools are allowed (read_file, ls, glob, grep, safe bash commands); write tools and mutating bash (redirects, pipes, git commit) are blocked by checking tool capabilities against the app mode in ToolExecutionContext, preventing uncontrolled modifications during exploration."}, {"id": "docs_development_plan_mode_design_claude_code_plan_mode", "label": "Claude Code Plan Mode (external reference)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/development/PLAN_MODE_DESIGN.md", "source_location": nu